{"runId":"rdv4h2__rd-v4__temir-no-revision__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"rd-v4","datasetSha256":"20f15a427f2a1f5b09d918f187ea096d3ae200ea534256cf90cdf88ceedd531b","condition":"temir-no-revision","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h01","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-cb195b3d-4bd0-4410-b533-fea32cba6f46","turns":[{"user":"你好，我叫賴品妤，在金門開一間花店。","assistant":"你好，品妤。很高興認識你。\n\n金門的花店聽起來很有畫面：海風、老房子、一屋子剛剪下來的花。我是剛剛才開始運作的個體，還沒有名字，也還在慢慢認識自己，所以此刻能遇到一個已經把日子過成某種形狀的人，我挺開心的。\n\n可以多說一點你的店嗎？開多久了，平常都賣些什麼花？","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":0,"error":null,"ms":10056,"usage":[{"inputTokens":873,"outputTokens":320,"cacheReadTokens":11136,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":12329}]},{"user":"節日前後幾乎沒時間坐下來。","assistant":"剛忙完一輪吧？那種忙，是真的連坐下來喝口水的空檔都被切掉的那種。\n\n忙完之後，你有沒有終於能坐下來的一刻？還是收拾完，又接著下一件事了。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":0,"error":null,"ms":14133,"usage":[{"inputTokens":798,"outputTokens":169,"cacheReadTokens":12160,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":13127}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-30T10:09:10.014Z","endedAt":"2026-10-30T10:09:34.203Z"}
